\caption{Trip deadline miss ratio across attack rates. Standard FIFO queues experience 100\% deadline failure at all rates $\ge$10K\,pps; PQAC maintains 0.00\% deadline miss up to 100K\,pps ($<$1\% at 500K\,pps).}
